  "transcript": "Hi Scott, this is Annie from LeadFlow. I noticed you're hiring an administrative project assistant right now, which tells me the manual side of your operation is stretched. Here's what I keep seeing with DRE shops growing the way yours is. The bottleneck isn't the consultant work, it's the PDF form filling after the intake is done. One project can eat two or three hours just moving data from a form into the public report package, so I want to make this easy. I'll take your next real project, pull the intake data you already have, and autofill the complete DRE public report PDFs for you completely free within 48 hours. You keep the output no matter what. If the turnaround and accuracy make sense for how you work, we talk. If not, zero obligation. Scott, just say yes and I'll get started today.",
